    "original-info": "at 8 Tufnell House, Anson Road, Islington, , & Florence Emily Soul formerly Coles; St George's Tufnell Park; 1916-25 Wellingborough School, Northants; 1925 St Catharine's College Cambridge organ scholar, BA 1928, MA 1932; 1928 Hongkong & Shanghai Bank, London; 1930 organist & choir-master All Saints Upper Holloway N London 'pupil of Dr Harold Darke'; 1932 HK Bank Harbin, Manchuria; 1938 on leave England; 1938 HK Bank Johore Bahru, Malaya; 1941 mobil. Johore Volunteer Engineers; 1942 interned Singapore, Changi, later Sime Road Camp; 1943 (in Changi), composed Whitsunday anthem 'Spirit of mercy, truth and love' for male-voice choir; 1946 HK Bank Shanghai; 1950 HK Bank Singapore; 1951 HK Bank Calcutta, (accountant), organist & choir-master St John's Calcutta; 1955 HK Bank Hong Kong (sub-manager); 1958 HK Bank Calcutta (acting manager), organist & choir-master St John's; 1959 Hamburg (manager), organist English Church of St Thomas a Becket Hamburg; retd 1965; organist & choir-master St Wilfrid's Bognor Regis; , Cemetery gv 42078 sq 117",
    "sources": [
      {
        "source": "baptism 20 Jan 1907"
      }
    ],
    "remaining-info": "at 8 Tufnell House, Anson Road, Islington, , & Florence Emily Soul formerly Coles; St George's Tufnell Park; 1916-25 Wellingborough School, Northants; 1925 St Catharine's College Cambridge organ scholar, BA 1928, MA 1932; 1928 Hongkong & Shanghai Bank, London; 1930 organist & choir-master All Saints Upper Holloway N London 'pupil of Dr Harold Darke'; 1932 HK Bank Harbin, Manchuria; 1938 on leave England; 1938 HK Bank Johore Bahru, Malaya; 1941 mobil. Johore Volunteer Engineers; 1942 interned Singapore, Changi, later Sime Road Camp; 1943 (in Changi), composed Whitsunday anthem 'Spirit of mercy, truth and love' for male-voice choir; 1946 HK Bank Shanghai; 1950 HK Bank Singapore; 1951 HK Bank Calcutta, (accountant), organist & choir-master St John's Calcutta; 1955 HK Bank Hong Kong (sub-manager); 1958 HK Bank Calcutta (acting manager), organist & choir-master St John's; 1959 Hamburg (manager), organist English Church of St Thomas a Becket Hamburg; retd 1965; organist & choir-master St Wilfrid's Bognor Regis; , Cemetery gv 42078 sq 117"
  },
